  "description": "<p data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"581\">De <strong data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"320\">Tactglove Haptic Gloves DK1</strong> bieden een indrukwekkende, realistische haptische ervaring voor VR-games, simulaties en interactieve software. Dankzij de geavanceerde sensoren, haptische feedback en nauwkeurige tracking voelt elke aanraking, beweging en interactie natuurlijk en direct aan.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"706\">Dit exemplaar verkeert <strong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"634\">Zo Goed Als Nieuw (ZGAN)</strong>: minimale tot geen gebruikssporen en volledig getest, 100% functioneel.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"725\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<li data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"798\">\r\n<p data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"798\">🖐️ <strong data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"754\">Haptische feedback</strong> voor realistische aanraking en interactie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"859\">\r\n<p data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"859\">🎮 Perfect voor VR-games, training, simulatie & research</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"927\">\r\n<p data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"927\">🎯 Zeer <strong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"894\">nauwkeurige tracking</strong> voor precieze vingerbewegingen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"998\">\r\n<p data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"998\">🔧 Compatibel met diverse VR-platformen (afhankelijk van software)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1046\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1046\">🧤 Comfortabel ontwerp voor langere sessies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1089\">✔️ 100% getest en volledig functioneel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1094\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1118\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1614\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1161\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1161\"><strong data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1131\">Model:</strong> Tactglove Haptic Gloves DK1</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1201\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1201\"><strong data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1174\">Staat:</strong> ZGAN (Zo Goed Als Nieuw)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1254\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1254\"><strong data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1213\">Type:</strong> Haptische handschoenen / VR-accessoire</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1342\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1272\"><strong data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1270\">Functies:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1342\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1297\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1297\">Haptische feedback</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1318\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1318\">Vingertracking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1342\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1342\">Bewegingssensoren</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1398\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1398\"><strong data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1357\">Gebruik:</strong> VR-gaming • simulatie • training • R&D</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1473\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1473\"><strong data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1421\">Compatibiliteit:</strong> Afhankelijk van ondersteunde software & platforms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1614\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1614\"><strong data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1492\">Meegeleverd:</strong><br data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1495\">✔ Tactglove Haptic Gloves DK1<br data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1529\"><em data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1614\">(Eventuele kabels, dongles of extra onderdelen kan ik toevoegen indien aanwezig.)</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1619\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1654\"><strong data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1644\">Incl. Garantie:</strong> 1 maand</h3>",
